{"id":"vod_zy360_66225","vodId":"66225","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"博人传火影忍者新时代","name_cn":"博人传火影忍者新时代","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全192集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241020-1/0247f302c001ef9871b8f56e2b0d0077.jpg"},"summary":"随着和平的到来而走向近代化的木叶隐村。高楼林立，巨大显示屏中播放出影像，连结各区域的电车在村里奔驰。虽说是忍者村，但一般民众也增多，忍者的生存方式也在逐渐改变着。 动漫主要讲述了《火影忍者》主角漩涡鸣人的儿子，漩涡博人的故事。忍者因为和平时代的到来，不再如往日重要。忍者学校也开始设立普通班。在这样一个和平的时代，博人选择了尾随自己父亲的脚印，成为忍者。 故事以这样的背景展开，但逐渐，一切又不和平了起来。博人能否应对呢？他会成为新时代的英雄吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-08-19 16:50:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":192,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/7yQDX5Ea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/yr2jeLHX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/spPjWGxM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/JStQ4Ur4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241018/61QtOpQs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/BxwyyF1P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241018/EOviROxA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/aFqa39s9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/TKoq1QQq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241018/phlBXjM3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/pOskEq5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/cEYAGcvj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/EHzpOTgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250819/fOIfvvs2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/qPwLx3Ug/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vod2.maow